"""Lab checks for the nightly sign-up pipeline. Do not edit this file.

Each test is named after the README task it checks; most failure messages also say what to do next.
The database checks need DATABASE_URL (README, Setup). They create a schema of their own named
pipeline_lab_<12 hex characters>, run schema.sql inside it, point your code at it, and drop it when they finish.
The enrichment checks use the offline FakeModelClient: no network, API key or paid AI call.
Run every check from the lab folder:  python -m pytest -q
"""

